From: pom11 <parsecoriginalmastercraft@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 12:39:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] feat(kanban): kanban_submit_review tool + running->review
 transition

Add submit_review_task transition (running -> review) so workers can
move code tasks into review status for automated review agents.

Changes:
- hermes_cli/kanban_db.py: submit_review_task() clears claim_lock +
  claim_expires + worker_pid so review dispatcher can claim the task;
  emits submitted_review event
- tools/kanban_tools.py: kanban_submit_review worker tool with schema +
  handler + registration (mirrors kanban_block pattern)
- agent/prompt_builder.py: KANBAN_GUIDANCE now instructs code tasks to
  kanban_submit_review instead of kanban_block(reason="review-required")
- tests/test_kanban_submit_review.py: 2 tests (running->review success,
  non-running returns False)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
